# ⚖️ Legal Case Management Microservices Platform

> ### A production-grade, cloud-ready **Legal Case Management Backend System** built on a modern microservices architecture — engineered to handle the full lifecycle of legal matters, from client intake to case resolution, court scheduling, and secure billing.

**✍️ Created & Maintained by [Asoh Yannick](https://github.com/asohyannick) — .NET Backend Developer** 👨‍💻🚀

