## 🌟 Overview

The **Legal Case Management Microservices Platform** is a fully distributed, event-driven backend designed to power law firms, legal departments, and courts of any scale. Every facet of legal practice is covered — from client onboarding and conflict-of-interest checks to court date scheduling, secure document e-signing, granular time tracking, and automated billing.

Each service is **independently deployable**, **loosely coupled** via **Apache Kafka**, and exposes versioned **REST APIs** secured with **JWT authentication** and **role-based access control** (Client, Paralegal, Associate, Partner, Admin).

### ✨ Key Highlights

> ⚖️ **Full Case Lifecycle** — intake, assignment, court scheduling, resolution, and archiving

> 📝 **DocuSign Integration** — send, track, and store legally binding e-signatures on documents

> 🏛️ **Court API Integration** — sync hearing dates, docket entries, and filing deadlines automatically

> 🔍 **Conflict-of-Interest Checks** — automated checks against client and opposing party records before case acceptance

> ⏱️ **Time Tracking & Billing** — billable hour capture, invoice generation, and Stripe payment processing

> 💬 **Secure Client Communications** — encrypted message threads tied to case records

> 🗄️ **Polyglot Persistence** — right database for each service (PostgreSQL · MySQL · MongoDB · Redis)

> ⚡ **Redis Caching** — sub-millisecond reads for conflict checks, case lookups, and session data

> 🧪 **Test Pyramid** — Unit, Integration, and Functional tests with Testcontainers

---

## 🏛️ Architecture

```
                    ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
                    │                   API  Gateway                    │
                    │         Routing · JWT Auth · Rate Limiting        │
                    │              Role-Based Access Control            │
                    └───┬──────┬───────┬──────┬──────┬─────────────────┘
                        │      │       │      │      │
          ┌─────────────▼─┐  ┌─▼───────▼─┐  ┌▼──────────────┐  ┌─────────────────┐
          │  Auth Service  │  │   Case     │  │   Document    │  │  Court Schedule │
          │ (PostgreSQL +  │  │  Service   │  │   Service     │  │    Service      │
          │    Redis)      │  │(PostgreSQL)│  │  (MongoDB +   │  │  (PostgreSQL)   │
          │                │  │            │  │   DocuSign)   │  │  + Court APIs   │
          └────────────────┘  └────────────┘  └───────────────┘  └─────────────────┘
                        │          │               │                    │
          ┌─────────────▼─┐  ┌─────▼──────────┐  ┌▼──────────────────────────────┐
          │Conflict Check  │  │ Communication  │  │       Billing Service          │
          │   Service      │  │    Service     │  │  (PostgreSQL + Stripe +        │
          │  (Redis +      │  │   (MongoDB)    │  │   Time Tracking + Invoicing)   │
          │  PostgreSQL)   │  │                │  │                                │
          └────────────────┘  └────────────────┘  └────────────────────────────────┘
                        │          │               │                    │
                        └──────────┴───────────────┴────────────────────┘
                                                   │
                                      ┌────────────▼────────────┐
                                      │      Apache  Kafka       │
                                      │   Domain Event Bus       │
                                      └──────┬──────────┬────────┘
                                             │          │
                          ┌──────────────────▼──┐   ┌───▼──────────────────────┐
                          │  Notification Service│   │    Audit Log Service     │
                          │      (MySQL)         │   │      (MongoDB)           │
                          │  Email·SMS·In-App    │   │  Immutable Audit Trail   │
                          └─────────────────────┘   └──────────────────────────┘
```

> 🔒 All external traffic flows exclusively through the **API Gateway**.
> ⚡ **Redis** sits in front of Conflict Check and Auth for ultra-fast lookups.
> 📊 **.NET Aspire** provides distributed tracing, health checks, and metrics dashboards out of the box.

