## 🚀 Getting Started

### ✅ Prerequisites

| 🔧 Tool | 📌 Version | 🔗 Link |
|---|---|---|
| 🔵 .NET SDK | 10.0+ | [Download](https://dotnet.microsoft.com/en-us/download/dotnet/10.0) |
| 🐳 Docker Desktop | 24.0+ | [Download](https://www.docker.com/products/docker-desktop/) |
| 🐙 Git | Latest | [Download](https://git-scm.com/) |

---

### 📥 Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/asohyannick/legal_case_management.git
cd legal_case_management
```

### 📦 Restore & Build a Service

```bash
cd case_service
dotnet restore
dotnet build
```

---

## 🔑 Environment Variables

Copy `.env.example` to `.env` and populate your values:

```bash
cp .env.example .env
```

```env
# ─── Auth Service ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT=Development
ConnectionStrings__DefaultConnection=Host=localhost;Port=5432;Database=legal_auth_db;Username=postgres;Password=yourpassword
Redis__ConnectionString=localhost:6379
JwtSettings__Secret=your_super_secret_jwt_key_minimum_32_chars
JwtSettings__ExpiryMinutes=60
JwtSettings__RefreshTokenExpiryDays=7

# ─── Case Service ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
ConnectionStrings__DefaultConnection=Host=localhost;Port=5432;Database=legal_cases_db;Username=postgres;Password=yourpassword

# ─── Document Service ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
ConnectionStrings__MongoDb=mongodb://localhost:27017
MongoDb__DatabaseName=legal_documents
DocuSign__IntegrationKey=your_docusign_integration_key
DocuSign__SecretKey=your_docusign_secret_key
DocuSign__AccountId=your_docusign_account_id
DocuSign__BaseUrl=https://demo.docusign.net/restapi
DocuSign__WebhookSecret=your_docusign_hmac_secret

# ─── Court Schedule Service ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
ConnectionStrings__DefaultConnection=Host=localhost;Port=5432;Database=legal_court_db;Username=postgres;Password=yourpassword
CourtApi__PacerUsername=your_pacer_username
CourtApi__PacerPassword=your_pacer_password
CourtApi__BaseUrl=https://pcl.uscourts.gov/pcl/

# ─── Conflict Check Service ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
ConnectionStrings__DefaultConnection=Host=localhost;Port=5432;Database=legal_conflict_db;Username=postgres;Password=yourpassword
Redis__ConnectionString=localhost:6379
Redis__ConflictCacheTtlMinutes=120

# ─── Communication Service ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
ConnectionStrings__MongoDb=mongodb://localhost:27017
MongoDb__DatabaseName=legal_communications
Encryption__Key=your_aes256_encryption_key_base64_encoded

# ─── Billing Service ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
ConnectionStrings__DefaultConnection=Host=localhost;Port=5432;Database=legal_billing_db;Username=postgres;Password=yourpassword
Stripe__SecretKey=sk_test_your_stripe_secret_key
Stripe__WebhookSecret=whsec_your_webhook_signing_secret
Stripe__PublishableKey=pk_test_your_publishable_key

# ─── Notification Service ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
ConnectionStrings__MySql=Server=localhost;Port=3306;Database=legal_notifications;User=root;Password=yourpassword
Mail__Host=smtp.mailtrap.io
Mail__Port=587
Mail__Username=your_smtp_username
Mail__Password=your_smtp_password
Twilio__AccountSid=your_twilio_account_sid
Twilio__AuthToken=your_twilio_auth_token
Twilio__FromNumber=+1234567890

# ─── Kafka (all services) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Kafka__BootstrapServers=localhost:9092
Kafka__ConsumerGroupId=legal-platform-group
```

> ⚠️ **Critical:** Never commit `.env`, `appsettings.Development.json`, or any file containing real credentials.
> Only `.env.example` with placeholder values belongs in version control.

