## 🐳 Running with Docker

### 🟢 Start All Services

```bash
docker compose up --build
```

### 🎯 Start a Specific Service

```bash
docker compose up --build case_service
docker compose up --build billing_service
```

### 🔴 Stop & Clean Up

```bash
# Stop containers
docker compose down

# Stop and wipe all volumes (database data)
docker compose down -v
```

### 🌐 Service URLs After Startup

| 🧩 Service | 🌍 Base URL | 📋 Swagger UI |
|---|---|---|
| 🔐 Auth | http://localhost:5001 | http://localhost:5001/swagger |
| ⚖️ Case | http://localhost:5002 | http://localhost:5002/swagger |
| 📄 Document | http://localhost:5003 | http://localhost:5003/swagger |
| 🏛️ Court Schedule | http://localhost:5004 | http://localhost:5004/swagger |
| 🔍 Conflict Check | http://localhost:5005 | http://localhost:5005/swagger |
| 💬 Communication | http://localhost:5006 | http://localhost:5006/swagger |
| 💰 Billing | http://localhost:5007 | http://localhost:5007/swagger |
| 📩 Notification | http://localhost:5008 | http://localhost:5008/swagger |
| 📋 Audit Log | http://localhost:5009 | http://localhost:5009/swagger |

